{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":82,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܐܣܦ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܟܸܠܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܒܟܢܘܼܫܬܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܹ̈ܐ ܒܸܕܝܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܝܢܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܒܥܵܘܠܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܚܵܙܹܝܬܘܿܢ ܦܵܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ؟ ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܥܒ݂ܘܿܕܘܼܢ ܕܝܼܘܵܢ ܕܡܚܝܼܠܵܐ ܘܕܝܲܬܘܼܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܡܘܼܠܝܸܨܵܐ ܘܠܡܸܣܟܹܢܵܐ ܥܒ݂ܘܿܕܘܼܢ ܗܵܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܦܲܪܩܘܼܢ ܠܡܚܝܼܠܵܐ ܘܠܣܢܝܼܩܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܐܝܼܕܵܐ ܕܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܦܲܨܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܠܗܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܠܹܐ ܝܵܕܥܝܼ ܘܠܹܐ ܦܲܪܡܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܚܸܫܟܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܚܵܕܪܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܥܝܼܫܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܫܲܬܐܸܣܝܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܵܢܵܐ ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ: ’ܐܲܠܵܗܹ̈ܐ ܝܬܘܿܢ ܐܲܚܬܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܢܲܝ̈ ܥܸܠܵܝܵܐ ܟܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ.‘","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܵܝܬܝܼܬܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܲܝܟ݂ ܚܲܕ ܡ̣ܢ ܓܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܒܸܬ ܢܵܦܠܝܼܬܘܿܢ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܘܼܡ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܕܘܼܢ ܠܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܒܸܬ ܝܵܪܬܹܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/82.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/83.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/81.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}